title: Shots in the Square
subtitle: The police fire on a demonstration.
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: -1
view-if: {!
if (typeof RG === 'undefined') { return false; }
if (!RG.lw && this.game.scenes.lw_lib) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
return !!(RG.lw && RG.lw.ready('shooting'));
!}
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.lw) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
RG.lw.fire('shooting');
Q.lw_dead = RG.lw.rnd(3, 14);
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {militancy: 6, members: -0.01});
RG.news('Police fire on demonstrators in ' + Q.lw_town + ': ' + Q.lw_dead + ' dead', 3);
RG.ledger('The police killed ' + Q.lw_dead + ' demonstrators in ' + Q.lw_town + '.', 'lw_shoot_' + Q.lw_d);
!}

= Shots in the Square

The demonstration in **[+ lw_town +]** was against the price of bread and the arrest of three works councillors. Ten thousand marched to the town hall. Someone threw a stone, or a bottle, or nothing at all: the witnesses do not agree. The security police on the steps opened fire with rifles, and then with a machine gun.

[+ lw_dead +] are dead, among them a girl of fifteen and a man who had come out to see what the noise was. Dozens are wounded in the hospital, under police guard.

The town is silent tonight. Tomorrow it will want an answer, and so will [+ lw_d_name +].

- @strike: Call a general strike in the district.
- @funeral: Bury the dead together with all the workers' parties.
- @inquiry: Demand a public inquiry and the trial of the officers.
- @defence: Form armed defence squads for the next demonstration.

@strike
subtitle: The district stops for its dead. The state will see what the workers can do, and answer.
on-arrival: {!
RG.startStrike(Q.lw_d);
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {militancy: 4, repression: 4, loyalty: 4});
RG.lw.lean('offensive', 2, 5);
!}

By ten in the morning, nothing moves in [+ lw_d_name +]: no trams, no works, no pits. The strike committee meets in the town hall square, where the blood has not been washed off.

@funeral
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] A common grief, and a common front. The Right's line, and many workers' wish.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids any joint action with the social democrats.
on-arrival: {!
RG.lw.against('united_front');
Q.spd_relation += 5;
Q.uspd_relation += 4;
Q.worker_support += 3;
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: -3});
RG.lw.lean('unionist', 2, 5);
RG.lw.lean('offensive', 0, -3);
!}

The coffins are carried through [+ lw_town +] under the flags of three parties and every union. Fifty thousand walk behind them. At the graveside, a social democrat and a communist speak from the same cart.

@inquiry
subtitle: The Republic is put on trial for its police. Worker support grows. The Spartacist line.
on-arrival: {!
Q.worker_support += 2;
Q.stability -= 1;
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: -4, loyalty: 3});
RG.lw.lean('luxemburgist', 2, 4);
!}

Our lawyers collect a hundred statements from witnesses and print them as a pamphlet. The inquiry, when it comes, finds that the police acted in self-defence. The pamphlet sells forty thousand copies.

@defence
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Next time, the workers will shoot back. The red guard grows, and so does the danger.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids armed squads.
on-arrival: {!
RG.lw.against('uprising');
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {guards: 0.6, militancy: 4, repression: 6});
Q.red_guards_loyalty += 3;
RG.lw.lean('offensive', 2, 5);
RG.lw.lean('unionist', -1, -4);
!}

The young men who carried the wounded from the square come to the district office the next day, asking for rifles. The district finds some. The next demonstration in [+ lw_town +] marches with a guard on both flanks.
